{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The magnets with screw holes fit my recent interest in magnetic hooks and fasteners because they offer another practical way to mount and hang things.",
    "The caliper has a plausible connection to my fastener purchases because it could help check sizes, though I would wait until I actually needed those measurements."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The filament choices assume a 3D printing need that my recent selections do not show; different colors and materials do not make them useful for my current mounting needs.",
    "The wire connectors require a wiring task, and the feeler gauge requires a gap-measuring task. Neither follows naturally from my interest in hooks, washers, nuts, and bolts."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in hardware seems to have been stretched into an interest in supplies for almost any workshop project.",
    "Several filament choices repeat the same assumption that buying practical hardware means I also need 3D printing materials."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent selections repeatedly involve fastening, hanging, and magnetic attachment; that shared purpose matters more to me than a broad connection to tools.",
    "I rarely choose something just because it might be useful someday. A clear connection to a current need makes the mounting magnets more compelling than the measuring tools."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my mounting interests but stretched them too far into unrelated workshop supplies."
}"}
